---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Practical info"
  description="Venue, travel, accommodation and contact information for the ESPG Annual Postgraduate Conference."
>
  <p class="eyebrow">
    <a href={url('/conference')}>Conference</a>
  </p>
  <h1>Practical info</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Venue</h2>
    <p>
      The conference will be held at the University of Melbourne, Parkville campus. Specific
      room and building details will be published closer to the date.
    </p>

    <h2>Getting there</h2>
    <p>
      The Parkville campus is a short tram ride from Melbourne CBD. Trams 1, 3/3a, 5, 6, 16, 64,
      67, and 72 all stop at the campus. The closest train station is Melbourne Central
      (15-minute walk).
    </p>

    <h2>Accommodation</h2>
    <p>
      Visitors will be directed to university-affiliated accommodation and nearby hotels here.
      Details to follow.
    </p>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <p>
      All conference venues will be wheelchair accessible. If you have specific access
      requirements, please contact the organising committee in advance.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about the conference can be directed to the organising committee. Contact email
      will be added during content migration.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
